    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d293">

                <pb facs="0575" n="519" sameAs="frus:frus1876/pg519"/>

                <head>No. 283.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Cushing to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1875-09-29"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 29,
                        1875</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Telegraph of twenty-eighth received; shall I take new steps on it at once, or
                    wait for specific instructions on my numbers four eighty-seven, four ninety-two,
                    and five hundred one?</p>
                <closer><signed>CUSHING.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
